</section>
<section id="S3.SS1.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">NUC <math id="S3.SS1.SSS0.Px3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> Mac mini (cross-validation, <math id="S3.SS1.SSS0.Px3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N{=}50" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N{=}50</annotation></semantics></math> per size).</h4>

<figure id="S3.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3. </span>Cross-validation latency: NUC <math id="S3.T3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> Mac mini (<math id="S3.T3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N{=}50" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N{=}50</annotation></semantics></math> per payload size).</figcaption>
